# Local secrets and per-deployment configuration. wrangler.jsonc in the repo is
# a template with placeholder ids; a real deployment keeps its account id, D1 id,
# KV id and hostname in a copy named wrangler.<anything>.local.jsonc and deploys
# with `npm run deploy -- --config wrangler.<anything>.local.jsonc`.
